OL,3,APrioritise young people or risk a 'lost
OL,4,Ageneration', says Milburn, ahead of
OL,5,Amajor Neets report
OL,6,
OL,7,FTo do that, he's proposing that
OL,8,Funder-25s should no longer be able to
OL,9,Fclaim the health element of Universal
OL,10,FCredit, although some people would
OL,11,Fstill be eligible for extra help
OL,13,FMilburn will also propose lower rates
OL,14,Fof National Insurance for employing
OL,15,Fyoung people, and more apprenticeships
OL,17,FThe Conservatives say his report is
OL,18,F"too cautious" in parts - and too
OL,19,Freliant on the "expensive hand of the
OL,20,Fstate"
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
